            "n": "1",
            "t": "verse",
            "text": "oṁ  prātara-gnim prātari-ndram̐ havāmahe\nprātar mitrā varuṇā prātara-śvinā ।\nprātar bhagam pūṣaṇam brahmaṇaspatim\nprātas somamu-ta rudram̐ huvema ॥1॥",
            "translation": {
              "en": "At dawn we invoke Agni, at dawn Indra, at dawn Mitra and Varuṇa, at dawn the Aśvins. At dawn Bhaga, the deity of fortune, Pūṣan, Brahmaṇaspati, at dawn we invoke Soma, and also Rudra."
            },
